  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Artifacts for the paper titled \"TORAI: Multi-Source Root Cause Analysis for Blind Spots in Microservice Service Call Graph.\"</p><p dir=\"ltr\">This artifact repository contains 1 compressed file with 3 datasets for Online Boutique, Sock Shop, and Train Ticket, respectively. Each folder contains multi-modal telemetry data collected from the corresponding microservice benchmark system. </p><p dir=\"ltr\">The code to reproduce the experimental results in the paper is available at https://github.com/phamquiluan/RCAEval.</p><p><br></p>",
